  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of this project is to increase the health situation among the Jordanian host community and Syrian refugees by meeting the humanitarian health needs, building resilience and strengthening the national health system and services.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The grant is awarded to the Caritas Denmark project: Health Programme for Syrian Refugees and Vulnerable Jordanians in Jordan 2022-2023

The stated objective of the project is: Contribute to improving the health status of Jordanian host communities and Syrian refugees by meeting humanitarian health needs, promoting resilience, and strengthening the national health system and services (ref.: JRP 2020-2022)</narrative>
